{"id":"equilibrio","lemma":"equilibrio","pos":"noun","rank":3047,"glosses":["equilibrium, balance (state of being balanced)"],"ipa":"/ekiˈlibɾjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"equilibrios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-equilibrio.wav","examples":[{"text":"El equilibrio no es siempre fácil.","en":"Balance isn't always easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/820401","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"easy, facile, simple"}]},{"text":"Aún podemos conseguir el equilibrio.","en":"We can still break even.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300089","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to achieve"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Es un equilibrio muy delicado.","en":"It's a very delicate balance.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"delicate"}]},{"text":"Todavía podemos alcanzar el punto de equilibrio.","en":"We can still break even.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300090","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to reach"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"point"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Es fácil perder el equilibrio en grava suelta.","en":"It's easy to lose your footing on loose gravel.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803892","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"easy, facile, simple"},{"g":"to lose"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"gravel"},{"g":"release"}]}]}